# A write through node changes the field of the space above the method; a write to the bare name of a free input writes
# the place of the immediate caller, here the root (the book, #binding-caller-place; B02): after bare(5) the root's hits
# is 5, after put(9) it is 9. Until step 21.4 the row pinned the reading of 2026-11-18 «a write to the bare name changes
# only the value of the activation» (after_bare 4).
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: hits 0
        int: after_bare 0
        int: after_put 0
)
int: hits 4
sub: bare (int: v)
    hits := v
sub: put (int: v)
    node\hits := v
bare(5)
int: after_bare hits
put(9)

sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\hits := node\hits
    shared\Observed\after_bare := after_bare
    shared\Observed\after_put := node\hits
main()
